imes, and a large amount of research has gone into adapting Arts for contemporary warfare.","abilities":[],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":4000,"atk":350,"def":200,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"sarkaz_sentinel_leader":{"slug":"sarkaz_sentinel_leader","name":"Sarkaz Sentinel Leader","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Sentinel Leader.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"A seasoned Sarkaz mercenary who has been through many battles. They are responsible for scouting, patrolling, and issuing early warnings to the entire squad. Once attacked, the Herald will immediately issue a warning that Inspires the entire army, shifting allied Sarkaz on Standby into Combat-Ready mode.","abilities":["When injured, issues an alarm to immediately enhance the ATK and DEF of all enemy units, and makes enemies in Standby immediately enter Combat-Ready mode"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":5000,"atk":0,"def":160,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1}},"sarkaz_bladeweaver_leader":{"slug":"sarkaz_bladeweaver_leader","name":"Sarkaz Bladeweaver Leader","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Bladeweaver Leader.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"An elite Sarkaz mercenary who has mastered the combination of swordsmanship and Arts. The Originium flowing through their blood allows them to hold these crudely modified Arts-imbued greatswords. Though they won't attack while on Standby, they are capable of dealing melee attacks that inflict Arts damage while in Combat-Ready mode.","abilities":["Starts battle in Standby and will not attack; upon being injured, becomes Combat-Ready and inflicts Arts damage with melee attacks."],"levelCo